  portrait: {fileID: -4178046375966092550, guid: b3c041b6c13dccc4abdc2b83a6b63229, type: 3}
  healthPoints: 100
  charDescription: "Pavel Naumova is an athletic man(around 20, maybe younger), always
    alert and quick to react at any menace. Shaved head and three day beard, he knows
    a lot about how the army work. However he is an awful liar and as soon as soldier
    are close-by, he's panicking. It is not hard to guess he is a deserter trying
    to flee the conflit. Young recruit forced by his family to join the army to invade
    this land, he follow the orders to not disappoint his parents, but he\u2019s
    eyes opened up before what he was doing when he put a house on fire, hearing
    screams coming out of the flames. it was the moment he knew he had to stop and
    flee."
  bonus:
  - adroit
  - mauvais menteur
  - deserteur
  - combattant
